; the contrast: context G under the earlier port's shape.
; SINGLETONARG is the committed program with GENESIS moved back to
; a witness argument, so the spender names a genesis of their own
; choosing and the look-alike transaction validates. The spend
; command line that follows re-refuses the same transaction under
